    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/286ec1ecb8d8299bd8bab772e4c2e156.avif?t=1753437397\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as the protagonist and make your way through the story in visual novel format. Sit back, relax, and enjoy the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/a72518948fc422091484fce1dcce04e0.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's polished, caring, kind, and gets good grades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're just enjoying your life with her when one day, you get into an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up in the hospital, you've forgotten all about your family, friends\u2026 and her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You try to restore your memories, but other women approach you, taking advantage of your amnesia with half-truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you get your memories back and return to those blissful days with your girlfriend?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/5e9364347234be9a4cf25c4878e89b6a.poster.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/5e9364347234be9a4cf25c4878e89b6a.webm?t=1753437397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/5e9364347234be9a4cf25c4878e89b6a.mp4?t=1753437397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/64046b7bb1a44c9296aff1e1c9110554.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/35c188f52c5caddbbe5bc718f5eba938.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/4675560ef8448d15e9df702a3ebebb05.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/5e0aeb00d4f7e4e29a5357ee83ed753a.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=275 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/5b995d61cac226c6eb2c808658ca35e6.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honey Trap Amnesia uses live2D to show moving images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though you have a girlfriend, you give into temptation and cheat on her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your amnesia to your advantage and find yourself a new girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/486b6e2077e19111df29c572c36f601b.poster.avif?t=1753437397\" width=616 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/486b6e2077e19111df29c572c36f601b.webm?t=1753437397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315800/extras/486b6e2077e19111df29c572c36f601b.mp4?t=1753437397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
